&lt;p&gt;&lt;img data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/netherland-crosswalk/amsterdam-centrum-edge-crosswalk.jpg" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/netherland-crosswalk/amsterdam-centrum-edge-crosswalk.jpg 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/netherland-crosswalk/amsterdam-centrum-edge-crosswalk.jpg 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/netherland-crosswalk/amsterdam-centrum-edge-crosswalk.jpg 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/netherland-crosswalk/amsterdam-centrum-edge-crosswalk.jpg 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>成功大學 校園人行空間觀察速記</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/ncku-pedestrian-area/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2024 03:25:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/ncku-pedestrian-area/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;10 月底到成功大學比賽，順便觀察了一下校園的人行空間。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>東華 9/25 藝術學院道路勘查筆記</title><link>https://blog.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2024 01:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="道路勘查緣由"&gt;道路勘查緣由&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;車輛管理委員會（簡稱車管會）學生代表於 112-2 車管會提出
&lt;a
href = "https://ga.ndhu.edu.tw/var/file/6/1006/img/1710/400157295.pdf"
target = "_blank"
rel = "nofollow noopener noreferrer"
&gt;
&lt;span&gt;
兩案
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;，但礙於該學期末因為校園地震等災害事件而遠距教學，許多學生代表都離開學校了，因此原先委員會後的道路勘查工作延後至 113-1 學期。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在 112 整年度（2024 年）中，我出訪過歐洲西部國家、日本東部地區，參觀過當地的交通規劃，我認為這次的道路勘查是一個很好記錄下來的機會，這篇文章會包含當時視察的項目及我的看法。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/SCR-20241003-tiuv.png" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/SCR-20241003-tiuv.png 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/SCR-20241003-tiuv.png 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/SCR-20241003-tiuv.png 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/SCR-20241003-tiuv.png 1920w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
112 車管會會議記錄 - 學生代表提案內容
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h1 id="道路勘查實記"&gt;道路勘查實記&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="大學門-車道匯流"&gt;大學門 車道匯流&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;大學門主要討論了劃分車道，並且將動線規劃得更加明確，以避免車輛之間的衝突。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;現場考量礙於調整動線專業性，決議安排到第二期外環道改善工程，請交通技師評估及事後施作。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/20240703_4_3.jpg" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/20240703_4_3.jpg 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/20240703_4_3.jpg 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/20240703_4_3.jpg 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/20240703_4_3.jpg 1920w"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;
大學門出入口加入槽化區域，明確規範車輛行駛區域（繪圖：潘芊妤｜底圖圖資：國土測繪雲）
&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h2 id="藝術學院-人行鋪面及行人保護措施"&gt;藝術學院 人行鋪面及行人保護措施&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="銜接行穿線的人行道"&gt;銜接行穿線的人行道&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;從藝術學院往返外環停車場，需要穿越道路，現行行穿線劃設的位置無人行道與其銜接，勘查現場該處存在高低差，路口處也未做出差異化，一來身障人士無法進行穿越，行人也容易不小心被周遭的樹擋住，容易導致車輛不易察覺行人，造成雙方的用路安危。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;現場決議&lt;/strong&gt;：AC（柏油施工工法）柏油鋪面，製作下潛式人行道，用以銜接現有的行穿線。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="下潛式人行道，銜接現有行穿線" data-cf-image="true" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) min(720px, calc(100vw - 28px)), 720px" src="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/art-building-cross-walk-and-sidewalk.jpeg" srcset="https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/art-building-cross-walk-and-sidewalk.jpeg 640w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=960,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/art-building-cross-walk-and-sidewalk.jpeg 960w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1280,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/art-building-cross-walk-and-sidewalk.jpeg 1280w, https://img.imych.one/cdn-cgi/image/width=1920,quality=75,fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect/https://img.imych.one/ndhu-20240925-road-inspection/art-building-cross-walk-and-sidewalk.jpeg 1920w"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>